{"name": "HyperCore : Rhythm Bullet Hell", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1112390/extras/e30e06222eeab29a887347378a4c678f.poster.avif?t=1787143271\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1112390/extras/e30e06222eeab29a887347378a4c678f.webm?t=1787143271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">In HyperCore, the music is trying to kill you. Survive a relentless anti-rhythm action experience built around precision, mastery, and staying alive against the beat.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1112390/extras/402ab04151dffd461b9979ac8f52e0e0.poster.avif?t=1787143271\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1112390/extras/402ab04151dffd461b9979ac8f52e0e0.webm?t=1787143271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MASTER THE RHYTHM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every level in HyperCore can be played in multiple ways, rewarding precision, risk-taking, and mastery. Learn enemy patterns, react instantly, and push yourself toward perfect runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1112390/extras/7c788063207b2ef85eb2a37a0a8405bf.poster.avif?t=1787143271\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1112390/extras/7c788063207b2ef85eb2a37a0a8405bf.webm?t=1787143271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MULTIPLE WAYS TO PLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">STORY MODE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight through escalating rhythm-driven encounters and survive increasingly brutal tracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SCORE ATTACK</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take risks, stay close to danger, and build massive score multipliers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>INFINITE MODE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One mistake can end a run. Stay alive for as long as possible.<br/> </p> </div>", "short_desc": "HyperCore is a fast-paced anti-rhythm action game where every beat becomes a threat. Survive escalating challenges, chase leaderboard glory, and master multiple game modes.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1112390/header.jpg?t=1787143271", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "Multiplayer", "Indie", "Rhythm", "Shoot 'Em Up", "Music"], "developers": "Gameinaframe", "publishers": "Gameinaframe", "release_date": "Aug 18, 2026", "price": "$16.99", "appid": "1112390", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "18 August 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/MDxVDjCcvqI", "first_seen": 1787004000.0, "review_rank": 83}